      en: ["Delémont became the capital of the newly established canton of Jura in 1979.", "Delémont Castle served as the summer residence for the Prince-Bishops of Basel.", "The city is located at an average elevation of 435 meters above sea level.", "Two medieval gates, Porte au Loup and Porte de Porrentruy, remain intact.", "The city is situated at the junction of the rivers Sorne and Birse.", "The Delémont basin is one of the most fertile regions in the Swiss Jura."],
