      hu: ["Schwyz őrzi az 1291-es szövetségi levelet a Szövetségi Levéltár Múzeumában.", "Svájc (Schweiz) neve közvetlenül Schwyz városának nevéből ered.", "A Grosser Mythen csúcsa 1898 méter magasan magasodik a város fölé.", "Az Ital Reding-ház Közép-Svájc egyik legfontosabb patríciusháza.", "A Szent Márton-templom a barokk építészet kiemelkedő példája a régióban.", "Itt található a Victorinox, a világhírű svájci bicskák gyártójának székhelye."],
      ro: ["Schwyz găzduiește Carta Federală din 1291 în Muzeul Cartelor Federale.", "Numele Elveției derivă direct din denumirea orașului Schwyz.", "Vârful Grosser Mythen domină orașul de la o înălțime de 1.898 metri.", "Casa Ital Reding este unul dintre cele mai importante conace din Elveția Centrală.", "Biserica Sfântul Martin este un exemplu remarcabil de arhitectură barocă.", "Victorinox, producătorul briceagului elvețian, își are sediul principal aici."],
      en: ["Schwyz houses the Federal Charter of 1291 in the Museum of Swiss Charters.", "The name of Switzerland is directly derived from the town name Schwyz.", "The Grosser Mythen peak towers over the town at 1,898 meters.", "The Ital Reding House is one of the most significant manor houses in Central Switzerland.", "The Parish Church of St. Martin is a masterpiece of Baroque architecture.", "Victorinox, the maker of the Swiss Army Knife, is headquartered in the area."],
