      en: ["The merger of Bulle and La Tour-de-Trême took place on January 1, 2006.", "Bulle Castle was constructed between 1291 and 1331.", "The town currently has around 26,000 inhabitants.", "Bulle is situated at an altitude of 771 m above sea level.", "The Musée gruérien was opened in the year 1917.", "The tradition of cheese markets in Bulle dates back over 400 years."],
