      en: ["The Roman villa at Boscéaz originally contained more than 100 rooms.", "The round tower is the sole remaining part of the castle built in 1233.", "The Church of Notre-Dame features exquisite late Gothic fan vaulting.", "In 1536, Orbe was forcibly reformed by troops from the city of Bern.", "The town sits at an average elevation of 479 meters above sea level.", "Orbe was a significant center for limestone quarrying during the 19th century."],
