      en: ["Morges Castle was built as a square fortress with four circular towers.", "The annual Tulip Festival lasts for six weeks from March to May.", "Morges served as the seat of a Bernese bailiff from 1536 to 1798.", "The port of Morges was the most important on Lake Geneva in the 17th century.", "The town is located at an elevation of 374 meters on the lakeshore.", "Ignacy Jan Paderewski, a Polish composer, lived in Morges for many years."],
