      en: ["The Favarger chocolate manufactory was founded in 1826 in Geneva and moved here later.", "The 'Canal de Versoix' was originally intended to be part of a major harbor.", "Versoix was a French exclave on Lake Geneva from 1768 to 1815.", "The University of Geneva's observatory is located within the municipality.", "The town sits at an elevation of 385 meters above sea level.", "The annual 'Bol d'Or', the largest inland lake regatta, passes by Versoix."],
